# One scratch file per lesson: PROGRESS-NN.local.md, in that lesson's folder.
# Never committed. It holds the day-by-day — what was tried, what was wrong for a
# day, which regressions were caught — and is CLOSED rather than deleted when the
# lesson closes. Anything durable lives in CLAUDE.md and in the register instead.
**/PROGRESS-*.local.md
